格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Fotor Plugin for Agents","id":"gh:1370831755","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"fotor-agent-plugins","slug":"fotor-ai/fotor-agent-plugins","topics":["agent-plugins","claude","codex","cursor","dsh-plugin","fotor","grok","pi","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Fotor Plugin for Agents"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Fotor Plugin for Agents"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Create images, video and audio with Fotor, directly from your AI agent."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Agents ·\nFeatures ·\nCodex setup · Claude Code setup · Cursor setup · Pi setup · DeepSeek Harness set"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"up · Kimi Code Desktop / CLI setup · OpenCode Desktop / CLI setup ·\nDocumentation"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Supported Agents"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Agent | Plugin Version | Status | Getting started |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| **Codex** | 0.8.1 | Included | Install and connect |\n| **Claude Code** | 0.8.0 | Included | Instal"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"l and connect |\n| **Cursor** | 0.8.0 | Included | Install and connect |\n| **Grok Bot** | 0.8.0 | Via"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" Cursor package | Install and connect |\n| **Pi** | 0.8.0 | Included | Install and connect |\n| **Deep"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"Seek Harness** | 0.8.0 | Separate repository | Install and connect |\n| **Kimi Code Desktop / CLI** |"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" 0.8.0 | Separate repository | Install and connect |\n| **OpenCode Desktop / CLI** | 0.9.0 | Separate"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" repository | Install and connect |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Versions are Fotor package baselines verified for this publication, not agent versions. Separate rep"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ositories may publish newer versions; the collection channel does not change each package's own vers"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ublish newer versions; the collection channel does not change each package's own version or channel."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This snapshot includes Codex and Claude Code and Cursor and Pi. Installation and live-service accept"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ance are separate checks; see the verification scope below."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Both release channels connect to Fotor's production service and website. The test channel previews p"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"lugin changes; it uses your production account and credits."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Each skill includes its own four runtime reference documents. Platform installation, MCP registratio"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"n and any external bridge setup remain separate prerequisites."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Capability | What you can do |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **Images** | Generate images or edit them with prompts and references. |\n| **Videos** | Generate f"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rom text, frames, or supported media references. |\n| **Audio** | Compose independent soundtracks, ge"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"nerate tracks, edit songs, synthesize speech and podcasts, or separate vocals and accompaniment. |\n|"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" **Media uploads** | Upload local images, videos, and audio for reuse. |\n| **Image processing** | Up"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"scale images and remove backgrounds. |\n| **Website connection** | Open Fotor with your authorized MC"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"P identity. |\n| **Credits** | Query your own Fotor credit balance. |\n| **Task results** | Check subm"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"itted tasks and retrieve available results. |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Available models, parameters, and operations come from the connected Fotor service."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Codex"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Installation"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Use a Codex version with plugin support and Git access to this public repository. GitHub sign-in is "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"not required to install the public package. If `fotor-ai` is already registered from another source,"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" follow Switch release channel."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"#### Production release"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Install the released plugin from the default `main` branch. No branch selector is required."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Connect"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. Check the installed plugin and enabled state:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"2. Confirm version **0.8.1**, release channel **production**, and the **production** MCP endpoint `h"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ttps://mcp.fotor.com/mcp` in the installed package. Check any standalone Fotor MCP override before a"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"uthorization; it must use the same production endpoint.\n3. Open a new Codex task and ask:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Valid credentials are reused. When authorization is needed, complete Codex's sign-in flow in an exte"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"rnal browser, then choose \"Signed in and authorized; open Fotor in the in-app browser\" in the locali"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"zed confirmation prompt. You can also choose to keep waiting or cancel. After Codex confirms authori"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"zation, the plugin opens the website sign-in link in a visible in-app browser. See the connection wo"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"rkflow for verification and manual fallback."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For a read-only check without opening the website, ask: **Check only the Fotor MCP connection.**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Updates"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Refresh and reinstall from the currently selected channel:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Open a new task and verify the version, enabled state, and endpoint. An update keeps the selected br"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"anch; use the next section to change channels."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Codex marketplace migration"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Existing `fotor-codex` installations need this one-time migration; ordinary updates within `fotor-ai"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"` use the Updates section."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Migration changes the installation identity. Before removing anything, record the old source/ref, sc"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ope, version and enabled state, and confirm the destination catalog actually declares `fotor-ai`. A "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"source still declaring `fotor-codex` cannot install `fotor@fotor-ai`. Preserve required plugin data "},{"id":"p35s4","text":"using supported host controls. Never copy tokens or clear credentials to make a migration work."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Outside other catalog-bearing checkouts, remove only the old Fotor installation and its registration"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"utside other catalog-bearing checkouts, remove only the old Fotor installation and its registration:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Removal deletes the old installed cache. Then run the Installation commands above for the verified d"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"estination. Check `codex plugin list --marketplace fotor-ai --json` and the marketplace listing: onl"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"y one Fotor installation should be enabled, with the intended version, source and production MCP dec"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"laration. Open a new task. If migration fails, remove any partial new installation and restore the r"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"ecorded old source/ref and plugin through native controls. Skip removals already completed; inspect "},{"id":"p38s6","text":"current state before repeating the sequence."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Credential reuse across the identity change requires separate verification; do not promise that a su"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ccessful installation preserves authorization."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### Switch release channel"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Use one source for the `fotor-ai` marketplace. Choose the destination first, then run **one** of the"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" replacement sequences below. Run source changes outside another checkout containing the same market"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"equences below. Run source changes outside another checkout containing the same marketplace catalog."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Choose the production or test release channel"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"#### Production release"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Install the released plugin from the default `main` branch. No branch selector is required."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"#### Test release"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Install the test build from `release/test` for prerelease validation."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"### Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Repository access, stale installations, and sign-in"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
